{"id":"horn","name":{"en":"Horn","ja":"イッカク","tc":"獨角","sc":"独角"},"desc1":{"en":"I envy horns like these. If you had them on your head, you'd be a lot taller! And when you butt heads, you'd be a lot stronger.","ja":"「なっがーい角だね。…角って憧れるよね。　頭についてれば、ずいぶん身長伸びるのに…。　頭突きしたときだって、強くなるし」","tc":"「好長～的角喔……我很嚮往角，　要是我頭上有長角，身高就會變得很高……　而且頭槌也會變得很強。」","sc":"“好长～的角哦……我很向往角，　要是我头上有长角，身高就会变得很高……　而且头槌也会变得很强。”"},"desc2":{"en":"...Huh? Are you being serious?!","ja":"「…えっ、本気で言ってるの！？」","tc":"「……呃，妳是認真的嗎！？」","sc":"“……呃，你是认真的吗！？”"},"char1":"firis","char2":"liane","level":19,"trait":{"id":"awakening-heal","name":{"en":"Awakening Heal","ja":"気付けの癒し","tc":"提神的治癒","sc":"提神的治愈"}},"categories":[{"id":"animal-mat","name":{"en":"(Animal Mat)","ja":"（動物素材）","tc":"（動物材料）","sc":"（动物材料）"},"icon":"firis-category-animal-mat","add":false},{"id":"medicine-mat","name":{"en":"(Medicine Mat)","ja":"（薬の材料）","tc":"（藥材）","sc":"（药材）"},"icon":"ryza2-category-medicinal","add":false}],"locations":[{"id":"moon-catcher-pass","name":{"en":"Moon Catcher Pass","ja":"月掴み峠","tc":"摘月嶺","sc":"摘月岭"}}],"monsters":[{"id":"horn-rabbit","name":{"en":"Horn Rabbit","ja":"角ウサギ","tc":"角兔","sc":"角兔"}},{"id":"dire-rabbit","name":{"en":"Dire Rabbit","ja":"ダイアラビット","tc":"稜角兔","sc":"棱角兔"}},{"id":"snow-ear","name":{"en":"Snow Ear","ja":"スノウイヤー","tc":"雪年","sc":"雪年"}},{"id":"wild-horn-beast","name":{"en":"Wild Horn Beast","ja":"荒らぶる角獣","tc":"荒狂角獸","sc":"荒狂角兽"}}],"fixed_components":[{"color":"blue","name":{"en":"Medicinal","ja":"薬効成分","tc":"藥效成分","sc":"药效成分"},"value":25}],"random_components":[{"color":"green","name":{"en":"Thick","ja":"太い","tc":"粗的","sc":"粗的"},"value":20},{"color":"yellow","name":{"en":"Soured","ja":"尖っている","tc":"突出的","sc":"突出的"},"value":5}],"index":82}